title: Main Opponent
subtitle: Whom our polemics address.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_main_opponent.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'main_opponent') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.main_opponent (catalogue 4.2; technical reference 10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'main_opponent');
!}

= Main Opponent

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @nationalist_right
- @communists
- @capital_land
- @unconstitutional_force
- @easy_discard

@nationalist_right
title: The national right
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_nationalist_right_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_nationalist_right_present = 0 : The addressee of polemics: ZLN. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'main_opponent', 'nationalist_right').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_nationalist_right_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'main_opponent', 'nationalist_right');
!}
go-to: result

@communists
title: The communists
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_communists_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_communists_present = 0 : The addressee: the KPP. Polemics cost −2 relation each and can close the way to contact. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'main_opponent', 'communists').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_communists_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'main_opponent', 'communists');
!}
go-to: result

@capital_land
