@unconstitutional_force
title: Violence against the constitution, from any side
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_unconstitutional_force_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_unconstitutional_force_present = 0 : The addressee: a party with an open case of unconstitutional violence; without one, polemics are blocked. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'main_opponent', 'unconstitutional_force').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_unconstitutional_force_why +]
